1
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:07,700
Today, I'll show you how to cut and weld a practical product.
今天，我来演示如何切割和焊接一件实用的产品。

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:12,090
This is a kitchen spice rack.
这是一个厨房调料架。

3
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:16,130
It can be secured on the wall by tightening screws or nails through the holes.
可以用螺丝或钉子穿过这些孔，把它固定在墙上。

4
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:19,370
The spice rack is easy to install and remove.
这个调料架安装和拆卸都很方便。

5
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:23,170
Today, let's see how to make such a spice rack.
今天，我们来看看怎么做这样一个调料架。

6
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:26,930
Before our creation, let's decide the material type and thickness.
在动手制作之前，我们先确定材料类型和厚度。

7
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:32,490
As they determine the shielding gas, nozzles, gas pressure, and processing settings we apply.
因为它们决定了我们要使用的保护气、喷嘴、气压和加工设置。

8
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:35,770
Here we use 2 millimeter stainless steel as an example.
这里我们以 2 毫米不锈钢为例。

9
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:44,350
Then apply the corresponding nozzle, shielding gas and gas pressure as required.
然后按要求使用相应的喷嘴、保护气和气压。

10
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:47,030
First, let's prepare the devices.
首先，我们来准备设备。

11
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:53,550
This is X-Tool air compressor, this is X-Tool air dryer, and this one is X-Tool metal fab
这是 xTool 空压机，这是 xTool 干燥机，这台是 xTool MetalFab

12
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:56,670
laser welder used tubes to connect these devices.
激光焊机。用气管把这些设备连接起来。

13
00:00:56,670 --> 00:01:00,950
Use a tube to connect the air compressor and the air dryer inlet port.
用一根气管连接空压机和干燥机的进气口。

14
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:05,790
Look, this is the inlet port, and that is the outlet port.
看，这是进气口，那是出气口。

15
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:09,150
Use another tube to connect the outlet port and the laser welder.
再用一根气管连接出气口和激光焊机。

16
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:11,350
Now we've finished the device connection.
现在设备连接就完成了。

17
00:01:11,350 --> 00:01:17,670
Next, power on the air dryer, then power on the air compressor.
接下来，先打开干燥机电源，再打开空压机电源。

18
00:01:17,670 --> 00:01:21,350
Set the gas pressure to 1 megapascal.
把气压设为 1 兆帕。

19
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:25,070
Wait until the device generates gas.
等待设备产生气体。

20
00:01:25,070 --> 00:01:30,790
During this process, install the welding head to our X-Tool metal fab CNC cutter.
在这个过程中，把焊接头安装到我们的 xTool MetalFab 数控切割机上。

21
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:35,470
There are 2 grooves on the welding head and 2 pins on the device.
焊接头上有 2 个凹槽，设备上有 2 个定位销。

22
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:38,190
Align them and install the welding head.
把它们对齐，装上焊接头。

23
00:01:38,190 --> 00:01:44,270
If the welding head is right after processing, wear heat resistant gloves before the installation.
如果焊接头刚加工完，安装前要戴上耐热手套。

24
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:46,630
Now the welding head is well secured.
现在焊接头已经固定好了。

25
00:01:46,630 --> 00:01:49,070
Next, install the save gas nozzle.
接下来，安装省气喷嘴。

26
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:54,550
Also, please wear heat resistant gloves if the welding head is right after processing.
同样，如果焊接头刚加工完，请戴上耐热手套。

27
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:56,830
Rotate to remove the ordinary nozzle.
旋转取下普通喷嘴。

28
00:01:56,830 --> 00:01:59,670
Then rotate to install the save gas nozzle.
然后旋转装上省气喷嘴。

29
00:01:59,670 --> 00:02:02,680
Make sure it is tightened.
确保它已拧紧。

30
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,100
This is 2 millimeter stainless steel.
这是 2 毫米不锈钢。

31
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:10,250
Remember to remove its protective film on both sides.
记得撕掉它两面的保护膜。

32
00:02:10,250 --> 00:02:12,610
Next, secure the material.
接下来，固定材料。

33
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:14,290
Rotate to loosen the knob.
旋转松开旋钮。

34
00:02:14,290 --> 00:02:19,010
Then insert the material into the slot and align it properly.
然后把材料插入槽中，并对齐摆正。

35
00:02:19,010 --> 00:02:23,870
Insert the material into the left slot in the same way.
用同样的方法把材料插入左侧的槽中。

36
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:30,080
Lower the linkage levers and tighten the knobs on both sides.
放下联动杆，拧紧两侧的旋钮。

37
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:35,940
Insert the USB cable to our CNC cutter and power it on.
把 USB 线插到我们的数控切割机上，并打开电源。

38
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:38,560
Insert the other end to the computer.
把另一端插到电脑上。

39
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:42,840
Power on the laser welder.
打开激光焊机电源。

40
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:45,780
Remove the safety instructions and tap the confirm button.
移除安全说明，点击“确认”按钮。

41
00:02:45,780 --> 00:02:49,860
Wait until the touchscreen indicates that CNC cutter takes control.
等到触摸屏显示数控切割机已接管控制。

42
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:52,500
Next, let's prepare the software.
接下来，我们来准备软件。

43
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:57,600
Open X-Tool Studio and click new project.
打开 xTool Studio，点击“新建项目”。

44
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:02,900
Connect the device.
连接设备。

45
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:07,080
After connection, we can view the material via camera, which is convenient for pattern
连接后，我们可以通过摄像头查看材料，方便图案

46
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,600
positioning.
定位。

47
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:12,600
Import a design file for cutting.
导入一个用于切割的设计文件。

48
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:16,600
Add a lead in if the material thickness is 2 millimeters or more.
如果材料厚度为 2 毫米或以上，要添加引入线。

49
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:21,180
The lead in ensures smooth and complete cutting of the contour and leaves the cutting defect
引入线能确保轮廓切割得平滑完整，并把切割缺陷留在

50
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,700
outside the contour.
轮廓之外。

51
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:28,560
The lead in length is usually 1 to 3 times the material thickness, about 3 to 10 millimeters.
引入线长度通常是材料厚度的 1 到 3 倍，大约 3 到 10 毫米。

52
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:33,100
The material thickness in this video is 2 millimeters and thus requires a lead in.
本视频中材料厚度为 2 毫米，因此需要引入线。

53
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:37,860
The following shows how to add a 4 millimeter lead in, twice the material thickness.
下面演示如何添加 4 毫米的引入线，也就是材料厚度的两倍。

54
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:40,980
First, select all the objects and ungroup them.
首先，选中所有对象，并取消组合。

55
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:45,500
Then, add different colors to contours based on the lead in type they require.
然后，根据轮廓需要的引入线类型，给它们设置不同的颜色。

56
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:49,680
For contours that require external lead ins, set their colors to black.
对需要外引入线的轮廓，把它们的颜色设为黑色。

57
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:54,320
To do this, press shift and select all the target contours.
为此，按住 Shift 键并选中所有目标轮廓。

58
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:57,080
Right click to change their colors to black.
右键单击，把它们的颜色改为黑色。

59
00:03:57,080 --> 00:04:02,660
Next, we are going to add external lead ins to the black contours and inner lead ins
接下来，我们要给黑色轮廓添加外引入线，并给

60
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:03,900
to the red ones.
红色轮廓添加内引入线。

61
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:08,560
In general, solid patterns require external lead ins, like the parts in black in this
一般来说，实心图案需要外引入线，比如本视频中黑色的部分，

62
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:15,080
video, while hollow patterns require inner lead ins, like the parts in red in this video.
而镂空图案需要内引入线，比如本视频中红色的部分。

63
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:20,610
Select all the black patterns and add external lead ins.
选中所有黑色图案，添加外引入线。

64
00:04:20,610 --> 00:04:29,710
Set the lead in length to 4 millimeters, twice the material thickness, zoom in and you can
把引入线长度设为 4 毫米，即材料厚度的两倍，放大就能

65
00:04:29,710 --> 00:04:31,790
see these lead ins.
看到这些引入线。

66
00:04:31,790 --> 00:04:37,670
Then, select all the red patterns and add inner lead ins.
然后，选中所有红色图案，添加内引入线。

67
00:04:37,670 --> 00:04:45,570
Inner lead ins can be a bit shorter, for example, 3 millimeters.
内引入线可以短一点，比如 3 毫米。

68
00:04:45,570 --> 00:04:50,740
Okay, now the inner lead ins are added.
好，现在内引入线已经添加好了。

69
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:55,060
For hollow patterns, their inner sections will be cut and discarded, ensure that the
对于镂空图案，它们内部的部分会被切掉丢弃，所以要确保

70
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:59,260
lead ins are set inside to avoid damaging the desired parts.
引入线设在内侧，以免损坏需要保留的部分。

71
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:04,900
After adding lead ins, place patterns in proper position.
添加引入线后，把图案放到合适的位置。

72
00:05:04,900 --> 00:05:10,020
Click mode and select cutting with fixture as the processing mode.
点击“模式”，选择“带夹具切割”作为加工模式。

73
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:13,680
Click material and select the 2 millimeter stainless steel.
点击“材料”，选择 2 毫米不锈钢。

74
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:18,940
The settings are recommended based on the nozzle and the shielding gas we select.
这些设置是根据我们选择的喷嘴和保护气推荐的。

75
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:23,320
Click nozzle and select save gas nozzle.
点击“喷嘴”，选择省气喷嘴。

76
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:27,920
Select gas and select X-Tool air compressor.
点击“气体”，选择 xTool 空压机。

77
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:36,300
For better cutting results, click cab librate the capacitive sensor.
为了获得更好的切割效果，点击“校准电容传感器”。

78
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:43,530
Click a solid area on the canvas and wait until the calibration is done.
点击画布上的一个实心区域，等待校准完成。

79
00:05:43,530 --> 00:05:46,190
Then, preview the cutting position.
然后，预览切割位置。

80
00:05:46,190 --> 00:05:53,860
You can click the camera icon to capture a real-time image of the material, or click
你可以点击摄像头图标拍摄材料的实时图像，或者点击

81
00:05:53,860 --> 00:05:58,980
the framing button as shown in the video, which provides a more accurate preview.
视频中所示的走边框按钮，这样预览更准确。

82
00:05:58,980 --> 00:06:04,660
Observe the red spot and note that the cutting position must be at least 1.5 centimeters from
观察红点，注意切割位置必须留出至少 1.5 厘米，

83
00:06:04,660 --> 00:06:06,460
the edge.
从边缘算起。

84
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:10,700
Confirm the cutting position and click process.
确认切割位置后，点击“加工”。

85
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:14,420
Follow the instructions to adjust the cutting tip knob value.
按照说明调整切割头旋钮的数值。

86
00:06:14,420 --> 00:06:17,700
Ensure that the knob is turned to the required scale value.
确保旋钮转到要求的刻度值。

87
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:22,260
If the knob value is wrong, incomplete cutting or dross may occur.
如果旋钮数值不对，可能会出现切不透或挂渣。

88
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:25,980
Manually move the X-axis guide rail to the front.
手动把 X 轴导轨移到前面。

89
00:06:25,980 --> 00:06:27,940
Open the toggle latch.
打开搭扣锁。

90
00:06:27,940 --> 00:06:33,600
Adjust the knob to the required value minus 4 in this video.
把旋钮调到要求的数值，本视频中是 -4。

91
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:38,300
Then close the latch.
然后扣上搭扣。

92
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:40,860
Click start.
点击“开始”。

93
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:52,400
Close the lid and press the button on the device.
合上盖子，按下设备上的按钮。

94
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:57,320
Operate with heat-resistant gloves or after the cutting tip cools down, and use a hammer
戴上耐热手套操作，或者等切割头冷却后再操作，并用锤子

95
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:02,560
to knock off the cut parts, because workpieces in irregular shapes may not fall off due to
把切好的零件敲下来，因为形状不规则的工件可能会因为

96
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,560
friction.
摩擦而掉不下来。

97
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:08,820
Besides, doing so helps to avoid skin burns.
另外，这样做也有助于避免皮肤烫伤。

98
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:16,950
Loosen the fixtures to take out parts.
松开夹具，取出零件。

99
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:29,510
Pull out the base plate and fetch the rest of the parts.
拉出底盘，取出其余的零件。

100
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:33,270
Remove the cutting tip and replace with a welding tip.
取下切割头，换上焊接头嘴。

101
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:37,110
Align the protrusion of the welding tip and the groove of the welding head.
把焊接头嘴的凸起对准焊接头的凹槽。

102
00:07:37,110 --> 00:07:42,510
On the touch screen, tap system setting and check the value of focus scale reference.
在触摸屏上点击“系统设置”，查看焦点刻度参考值。

103
00:07:42,510 --> 00:07:45,350
Check if the welding nozzle is of the same value.
检查焊接喷嘴是否为相同的数值。

104
00:07:45,350 --> 00:07:47,770
If yes, no calibration is needed.
如果是，就不需要校准。

105
00:07:47,770 --> 00:07:50,510
If not, adjust the graduated tube.
如果不是，就调整刻度管。

106
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:51,510
Open the fastener.
打开卡扣。

107
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:56,190
Push or pull the welding nozzle to adjust it to the reference value.
推动或拉动焊接喷嘴，把它调到参考值。

108
00:07:56,190 --> 00:08:14,450
Pull the welding wire.
拉出焊丝。

109
00:08:14,450 --> 00:08:18,730
The welding wire should comes out from the groove of the welding nozzle.
焊丝应该从焊接喷嘴的槽中出来。

110
00:08:18,730 --> 00:08:21,450
The welding head is ready now.
现在焊接头已经准备好了。

111
00:08:21,450 --> 00:08:24,610
Tap machine status on the touch screen to view the gas state.
在触摸屏上点击“机器状态”，查看气体状态。

112
00:08:24,610 --> 00:08:28,890
To weld materials, use nitrogen or argon as the shielding gas.
焊接材料时，使用氮气或氩气作为保护气。

113
00:08:28,890 --> 00:08:33,050
Before replacing the gas, press the grip sensing button and trigger on the welding head for
更换气体之前，按下焊接头上的握持感应按钮和扳机，

114
00:08:33,050 --> 00:08:34,690
gas depressurizing.
给气体泄压。

115
00:08:34,690 --> 00:08:39,850
Keep depressurizing until gas pressure turns to zero kilopascals on the touch screen.
持续泄压，直到触摸屏上的气压变为 0 千帕。

116
00:08:39,850 --> 00:08:44,450
When replace the tube, push and hold the inlet collet and pull out the original tube.
更换气管时，按住进气口的卡套，把原来的气管拔出来。

117
00:08:44,450 --> 00:08:47,770
Insert the nitrogen tube into the inlet.
把氮气管插入进气口。

118
00:08:47,770 --> 00:08:52,070
A flow valve of 15 to 30 liters per minute is preferred for welding.
焊接时最好使用每分钟 15 到 30 升的流量阀。

119
00:08:52,070 --> 00:08:57,930
If not available, a pressure reducing valve with 0.1 to 0.2 megapascals works as an
如果没有，也可以用 0.1 到 0.2 兆帕的减压阀作为

120
00:08:57,930 --> 00:08:58,970
alternative.
替代。

121
00:08:58,970 --> 00:09:02,250
In this video, a pressure reducing valve is used.
本视频中使用的是减压阀。

122
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:06,850
This gauge displays the pressure inside the gas cylinder, while this one displays the
这个表显示的是气瓶内的压力，而这个表显示的是

123
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:08,570
output gas pressure.
输出气压。

124
00:09:08,570 --> 00:09:13,210
Next, adjust the output gas pressure of nitrogen.
接下来，调节氮气的输出气压。

125
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:17,050
Press the grip sensing button and trigger on the welding head while adjusting the valve
按住焊接头上的握持感应按钮和扳机，同时调节阀门

126
00:09:17,050 --> 00:09:23,290
knob until gas pressure turns to 200 kilopascals or so on the touch screen.
旋钮，直到触摸屏上的气压变为 200 千帕左右。

127
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:24,290
Tap standard mode.
点击“标准模式”。

128
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:27,850
Then weld, select stainless steel for the material type.
然后选择“焊接”，材料类型选择不锈钢。

129
00:09:27,850 --> 00:09:30,490
Select two millimeters for the material thickness.
材料厚度选择 2 毫米。

130
00:09:30,490 --> 00:09:33,290
Select one millimeter for the wire diameter.
焊丝直径选择 1 毫米。

131
00:09:33,290 --> 00:09:37,050
Tap enable wire feeding and enable lasering.
点击“启用送丝”和“启用激光”。

132
00:09:37,050 --> 00:09:39,890
Confirm.
确认。

133
00:09:39,890 --> 00:09:44,350
Remember to attach the workpiece sensing cable clamp to the conductive work table where you
记得把工件感应线夹夹在放置工件的导电工作台上，

134
00:09:44,350 --> 00:09:45,890
place the workpieces.
也就是你放工件的地方。

135
00:09:45,890 --> 00:09:50,730
By doing so, the current flows from the wire to the workpiece through the work table and
这样，电流从焊丝流向工件，经过工作台，再

136
00:09:50,730 --> 00:09:54,290
returns to the laser welder via the workpiece sensing cable.
通过工件感应线回到激光焊机。

137
00:09:54,290 --> 00:10:08,280
No laser will be emitted if the closed loop breaks.
如果闭合回路断开，就不会出激光。

138
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:11,460
Before welding, turn on the wire feed, enable switch.
焊接前，打开送丝使能开关。

139
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:13,640
This is the feed button.
这是送丝按钮。

140
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,800
This one is the retract button.
这个是回抽按钮。

141
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:22,080
Press the buttons to adjust the wire until its tip coincides with the red spot.
按这些按钮调整焊丝，直到它的末端与红点重合。

142
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,400
Now let's weld the materials.
现在我们来焊接材料。

143
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:27,360
Weld both ends of the materials.
先焊接材料的两端。

144
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:30,460
Then weld along the welding seam.
然后沿着焊缝焊接。

145
00:10:30,460 --> 00:10:33,560
Doing so ensures a straight welding line.
这样可以确保焊缝是直的。

146
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:37,760
Position the welding head at a 45 degree angle towards the welding seam.
让焊接头朝焊缝成 45 度角。

147
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:40,700
Press and hold the grip sensing button and trigger.
按住握持感应按钮和扳机。

148
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:45,360
The emitted laser fixes the materials with the wire.
发出的激光用焊丝把材料固定在一起。

149
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,840
Keep welding non-stop from the beginning to the end.
从头到尾不停顿地连续焊接。

150
00:10:47,840 --> 00:11:03,540
A force will push you forward, just follow that force and pull steadily backward.
会有一股力把你往前推，只要顺着这股力，稳稳地往后拉就行。

151
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:26,770
Since other parts are under less stress, connecting them only by welding the corners also works.
由于其他部位受力较小，只焊接拐角把它们连接起来也是可以的。

152
00:11:26,770 --> 00:11:30,930
If the welding seam is blackened after welding, replace with the cleaning nozzle to clean
如果焊接后焊缝发黑，就换上清洗喷嘴来清洁

153
00:11:30,930 --> 00:11:31,930
the seam.
焊缝。

154
00:11:31,930 --> 00:11:35,450
Remove the welding nozzle and the wire feeding tube.
取下焊接喷嘴和送丝管。

155
00:11:35,450 --> 00:11:40,360
Align and install the cleaning nozzle.
对准并装上清洗喷嘴。

156
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:44,860
Select the standard mode, choose clean, select the corresponding material, choose the
选择标准模式，选择“清洗”，选择对应的材料，选择

157
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:48,900
appropriate width, enable lasering and tap confirm.
合适的宽度，启用激光，然后点击“确认”。

158
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:55,540
Now let's clean the welding seam.
现在我们来清洁焊缝。

159
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:57,640
Easy peasy, right?
很简单，对吧？

160
00:11:57,640 --> 00:12:00,300
In general, the welding effect is very nice.
总的来说，焊接效果非常好。

161
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:05,740
Compared with traditional welding, the laser welder works faster and produces a better appearance.
与传统焊接相比，激光焊机速度更快，外观效果也更好。

162
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:21,170
The following concludes today's processing steps.
今天的加工步骤就到这里。

163
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:23,390
Here are some tips for smooth cutting and welding.
下面是一些让切割和焊接更顺利的小技巧。
